    "sub_ename": "COOPERATIVES AND ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程係以瞭解第三部門的經營特點及合作部門的經濟分析為主。課程設計包括非營利制度經濟學、非營利組織經營、合作組織演變、合作組織動態理論等項目。",
    "describe_eh": "Course Goals：1.Training Top-Flight Human Resources for Cooperatives Business, 2.Roots in Taiwan, Eyes on the world。Course Topics: 1.Intrinsic of Cooperatives Business, 2.Consumer Cooperatives Business, 3.Credit Cooperatives Business, 4.Agricultural Cooperatives Business, 5.Insurance Cooperatives Business.A",
